      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        188.43470764160156,
        372.3837890625,
        207.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "Have you thought about where to take them to eat?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        220.0520477294922,
        105.86299896240234,
        239.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        240.1547088623047,
        521.3265380859375,
        278.87359619140625
      ],
      "text": "Well, I really like all the food stalls at Clacton Market. My cousin’s vegetarian. I\nknow it’s one of the best places for that kind of food.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        291.6920471191406,
        128.062255859375,
        311.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        311.793701171875,
        499.81109619140625,
        370.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "Definitely, and there’ll be loads of choices for the kids too. You need to get\nthere quite early, though. At the weekend, most of the stores stop serving\nlunch at 2.30.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        383.2520446777344,
        105.86299896240234,
        402.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        403.23468017578125,
        522.4430541992188,
        441.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "Good point. It’s all going to need careful planning. My cousin said she’d love to\ntake the kids to a show at the theatre, but tickets are so expensive.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        454.7710266113281,
        128.062255859375,
        474.2724304199219
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        474.87469482421875,
        500.9322509765625,
        513.4735717773438
      ],
      "text": "I know. But you can get some good deals if you book online with bargained\ntickets for the following day. On some seats there a 75% discount.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        526.4110107421875,
        105.86299896240234,
        545.9124145507812
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        546.3937377929688,
        254.09878540039062,
        565.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Really. I must try and get some.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        578.1320190429688,
        128.062255859375,
        597.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        598.2347412109375,
        511.9299621582031,
        636.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "Yeah. There are lots of things you can do for free as well. No need to spend a\nfortune.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        649.6520385742188,
        105.86299896240234,
        669.1534423828125
      ],
